%% architecture.mmd - Single-instance architecture with real model-selected tools.
flowchart LR
    Browser[React browser] --> TLS[Caddy HTTPS]
    TLS --> Nginx[Nginx frontend / API / WebSockets]
    Nginx --> API[FastAPI single worker]
    Input[Simulated GPS and environment] --> API
    API --> Engines[Risk / motion anomaly / seclusion]
    Engines --> DB[(Persistent SQLite)]
    Watchdog[One-second watchdog] --> Agent[Strands Agent]
    Agent <--> Bedrock[Amazon Bedrock]
    Agent --> Tools[Scoped tool functions]
    Tools --> Gates[Fresh state / consent / deadline checks]
    Gates --> DB
    DB --> WS[Authorized WebSocket snapshots]
    WS --> Browser
